  "$comment": "Canonical cheki HTTP API contract fixtures. Every SDK test suite decodes these, and tests/contract/sdk-fixtures.test.ts checks that the real route handlers still produce the same shapes (same keys, same JSON types). Change a route and this file together, or CI fails. Values are illustrative; references and names are fake. receiptUrlCases: what getReceiptUrl must build (query params, any order) or reject. Current formats need no account; a legacy CBE FT reference does. served says how /api/receipt answers: a redirect to the bank's own page, or the bank's PDF.",
